# The Segment tool's length typed, then a click on the Elements list, which
# takes the field's keyboard and leaves the text there. Back over the
# canvas, the blank that Space types leaves the text alone, so Space + drag
# pans instead of placing the second point; a letter leaves it alone too.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 724 291
move 760 250 3
text "1"
wait 3
click L 1400 300
wait 3
move 600 400 3
wait 2
keydown Space
text " "
wait 2
drag L 600 400 700 450
keyup Space
wait 3
text "h"
wait 3
